{"id":"s2.1.2","slug":"cubes","title":"Cubes","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Memorizing cubes of numbers is also highly beneficial for speed. At a minimum, knowing cubes up to 10 is essential, but memorizing further will save valuable time on the test. The following cubes are frequently encountered:</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-4 text-sm\"><div><strong>5³</strong> = 125</div><div><strong>6³</strong> = 216</div><div><strong>7³</strong> = 343</div><div><strong>8³</strong> = 512</div><div><strong>9³</strong> = 729</div><div><strong>10³</strong> = 1000</div><div><strong>11³</strong> = 1331</div><div><strong>12³</strong> = 1728</div><div><strong>13³</strong> = 2197</div><div><strong>14³</strong> = 2744</div><div><strong>15³</strong> = 3375</div><div><strong>16³</strong> = 4096</div><div><strong>17³</strong> = 4913</div><div><strong>18³</strong> = 5832</div><div><strong>19³</strong> = 6859</div><div><strong>20³</strong> = 8000</div></div>","summary":"Memorizing cubes of numbers is also highly beneficial for speed.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem that requires knowing the cube of a number between 5 and 20.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $\\sqrt[3]{1728}$.","answer":"12","kind":"exact","tags":["logs-exponents"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $11^3$.","answer":"1331","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $14 \\times 14 \\times 14$.","answer":"2744","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $(-343)^{1/3}$.","answer":"-7","kind":"exact","tags":["logs-exponents"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $12^3$.","answer":"1728","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $16^3$.","answer":"4096","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $\\sqrt[3]{1728} \\div \\sqrt{36}$.","answer":"2","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","logs-exponents"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $11^4 \\div 11$.","answer":"1331","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate